flowchart TD
    %% External users and voice interfaces
    PhoneCaller[Phone Caller] --> Twilio[Twilio Programmable Voice]
    BrowserUser[Browser Voice User / TA] --> BrowserUI[Browser Voice UI]

    %% Twilio phone route path
    Twilio --> VoiceIncoming[POST /voice/incoming]
    Twilio --> VoiceTurn[POST /voice/turn]
    Twilio --> VoiceStatus[POST /voice/status]

    %% Browser route path
    BrowserUI --> BrowserStart[POST /api/browser/start-call]
    BrowserUI --> BrowserTurn[POST /api/browser/voice-turn]
    BrowserUI --> RootUI[GET / or GET /ui]

    %% Shared API layer
    VoiceIncoming --> Routes[FastAPI Route Layer]
    VoiceTurn --> Routes
    VoiceStatus --> Routes
    BrowserStart --> Routes
    BrowserTurn --> Routes
    RootUI --> Routes

    %% Shared agent core
    Routes --> Agent[Shared Agent Orchestrator]

    %% LLM and fallback
    Agent --> LLM[Anthropic Claude Haiku\nclaude-haiku-4-5]
    Agent --> Fallback[Deterministic Fallback Parser]

    %% MCP layer
    Agent --> MCP[MCP Tool Registry]

    MCP --> MenuTools[Menu Search and Dietary Tools\nsearch_menu / get_menu_item / check_dietary_info]
    MCP --> OrderTools[Order Mutation and Confirmation Tools\nadd / remove / update / summary / confirm / cancel]
    MCP --> TotalTool[Pricing and Total Tool\ncompute_total]

    %% Menu/RAG layer
    MenuTools --> Retriever[Hybrid RAG Menu Retriever]
    Retriever --> CanonicalMenu[Canonical Menu JSON\ndata/processed/menu.json]
    Retriever --> RAGIndex[RAG Index Files\ndata/index/menu_chunks.json\ndata/index/menu_metadata.json]
    Retriever --> Embeddings[Local Embeddings\ndata/index/embeddings.npy\nall-MiniLM-L6-v2]

    %% Order and pricing layer
    OrderTools --> OrderStore[Order Store]
    TotalTool --> Pricing[Pricing Module]
    Pricing --> CanonicalMenu
    Pricing --> OrderStore

    %% Session and dialogue state
    Agent --> SessionStore[Session and Dialogue State Store]
    SessionStore --> TwilioMap[Twilio CallSid to Session ID Map]
    TwilioMap --> PhoneObservability[Phone Observability\ntwilio_call_sid + session_id]

    %% Menu ingestion pipeline
    MenuInput[Restaurant Menu URL / File / Text / Fixture] --> Ingestion[Menu Ingestion Pipeline]
    Ingestion --> CanonicalMenu
    CanonicalMenu --> IndexBuilder[RAG Index Builder]
    IndexBuilder --> RAGIndex
    IndexBuilder --> Embeddings

    %% Logging and debug inspection
    Routes --> Logs[Structured JSON Logs]
    Agent --> Logs
    MCP --> Logs
    Retriever --> Logs
    OrderStore --> Logs
    Pricing --> Logs
    LLM --> Logs
    Fallback --> Logs

    Routes --> DebugRoutes[Debug and Session Inspection Routes\nGET /api/debug/sessions/recent\nGET /api/debug/session/{session_id}]
    DebugRoutes --> SessionStore
    DebugRoutes --> OrderStore
    DebugRoutes --> PhoneObservability
